  "notes": [
   "BOUNDARY WEEK. GA4 bookings are the CREATE PATH only from this week: eventName EXACT sevenrooms_booking_complete AND pagePath NOT PARTIAL_REGEXP modify|manage|prearrival. Boundary date 12 October 2026.",
   "Amendment share measured per venue for both years. 2026: 4.1 percent of gross in W37 and 7.6 percent in W36. 2025: zero. The 2025 property fired the event only on /reservations/<venue> routes; there were no modify, manage or prearrival page paths in the 2025 data at any Hong Kong venue, so the create-path rule leaves every 2025 figure unchanged and the two years are on the same basis.",
   "VERIFIED: the gross reconstruction reproduces every published week exactly for all nine venues (Aqua W30-W36 175/208/184/220/229/178/206 against published; Hutong, TCL, Cantina, DSL, Shiro PP, Shiro TK, Vesu and Canton all match).",
   "MEASUREMENT BREAK, THE HEADLINE OF THE WEEK. sevenrooms_booking_complete stopped recording properly across the Hong Kong estate from 15 to 16 October 2026. Cantina recorded ZERO booking events on 16, 17 and 18 October while page_view (283/303/322) and book_now_button_click (9/7/3) kept firing and SevenRooms recorded seven website bookings a day. Aqua daily create-path bookings ran 36/31/27/28 to 15 Oct then 10/19/14. averageSessionDuration at Aqua ran 205/190/219/357 seconds to 15 Oct then 2408/513/1748 seconds. The same session-duration jump appears at every venue except The Canton Library (93.8s against 92.4s prior), which is on the newest property.",
   "CROSS-CHECK: SevenRooms website-channel booking ROWS for the portfolio seven venues were 746 in 5-11 Oct and 780 in 12-18 Oct, up 4.6 percent, while GA4 create-path bookings fell from 879 to 588, down 33.1 percent. Aqua GA4 create-path 12-15 Oct = 116 against SevenRooms website 116 (ratio 1.00); 16-18 Oct GA4 43 against SevenRooms 75.",
   "bounce and engrate are RAW 0-1 FRACTIONS from the GA4 API (not percentages). asd = averageSessionDuration in seconds. Current-week engagement metrics are provisional and this week they are also distorted by the tag break.",
   "weekly buckets built with GA4 isoYearIsoWeek (Mon-Sun); users pulled with isoYearIsoWeek as a dimension, never summed from daily. Prior-week site metrics re-pulled and reproduce last week published figures exactly (Aqua 5050 sessions / 3662 users / 13349 pageviews / asd 239.392 / bounce 0.30752).",
   "YTD is a single un-dimensioned eventCount call over 2026-02-01..2026-10-18 on the OLD GROSS basis, so the YTD line stays continuous with every published week. VERIFIED: for all nine venues YTD equals last week published YTD plus this week GROSS bookings exactly (Aqua 7076+165=7241, Hutong 10187+203=10390, TCL 4286+67=4353, Cantina 2515+20=2535, DSL 5638+97=5735, Shiro PP 2930+37=2967, Shiro TK 2311+24=2335, Vesu 1438+49=1487, Canton 154+50=204).",
   "The Chinese Library (356942576) and Cantina (359148527) time out on 7-metric calls; pulled in a 4-metric and a 3-metric group.",
   "Shiro Pacific Place = combined Shiro minus Shiro Tai Kwun (users, sessions, pageviews and newUsers are residuals, not a direct pull). Tai Kwun users use pagePath PARTIAL_REGEXP central|taikwun; Tai Kwun bookings use eventName + pagePath PARTIAL_REGEXP shirotaikwun. Pacific Place engagement metrics are read directly with a NOT filter on that page path. The 2025 Tai Kwun filter returns no data (re-verified this week).",
   "Shiro split sums: create path Tai Kwun 24 + Pacific Place 35 = combined 59; the channel splits sum to 59 as well. YTD 2335 + 2967 = 5302 (direct combined pull).",
   "All landing pages aggregate each venue top-5 landing pages by path, so the list is indicative not exhaustive. (not set) and empty-string rows are excluded."
  ],
