 "tracking_break": {
  "finding": "GA4 measurement broke across the HK estate from 15-16 Oct 2026. sevenrooms_booking_complete stopped firing entirely at Cantina from 16 Oct (0 events on 16,17,18 Oct against 7 website bookings a day in SevenRooms) and under-fires elsewhere. averageSessionDuration inflated 3-6x in the same window (Aqua daily asd: 12th 205s, 13th 190s, 14th 219s, 15th 357s, 16th 2408s, 17th 513s, 18th 1748s).",
  "proof": "SevenRooms website-channel bookings for the portfolio six/seven venues rose 4.6% week on week (746 in 5-11 Oct to 780 in 12-18 Oct) while GA4 create-path bookings fell 33% (879 to 588). Cantina page_view and book_now_button_click kept firing normally on 16-18 Oct while sevenrooms_booking_complete was zero, so this is a tag break, not a data-processing lag.",
  "unaffected": "The Canton Library (property 548638742) shows no asd inflation (93.8s vs 92.4s prior) and its bookings rose, so the newest property is clean.",
  "ga4_vs_sr_aqua": "Aqua GA4 create-path 12-15 Oct = 116 against SevenRooms website 116 (ratio 1.00); 16-18 Oct GA4 43 against SevenRooms 75."
